719
00:44:54.893 --> 00:44:56.793
<font color=#808080>[هەژ]</font>

720
00:44:56.795 --> 00:44:58.327
*چۆن؟ *چۆن؟ *چۆن؟

721
00:45:04.803 --> 00:45:06.402
<font color=#808080>[snares]</font>

722
00:45:07.872 --> 00:45:11.374
